  'Oito2PasswordField': ApiEntry(kind: 'class', package: 'oito2_ui', doc: 'A password text field with a button that shows or hides the text and\na warning while Caps Lock is on.\n\nIt fills from password managers through [autofillHints]; use\n[AutofillHints.newPassword] for a field that sets a new password.\n\nWith [showStrength], a meter below the field rates the password while\nit isn\'t empty: four segments tinted from the danger to the success\ntone, the level name and the first suggestion that would make it\nstronger. [Oito2PasswordStrength.estimate] rates it on the device by\ndefault; [strengthEstimator] replaces it. Assistive technologies hear\nthe level when it changes, not on every key.\n\nThe error of [validator] or [required] shows after the field loses\nfocus, or at once after its [Oito2Form] found errors; [errorText] wins\nover it.', signature: '', constructors: [ApiConstructor(name: 'Oito2PasswordField', doc: 'Creates a password field.', isConst: true, isFactory: false, parameters: [ApiParameter(name: 'participatesInForm', type: 'bool', isRequired: false, isNamed: true, defaultValue: 'true', doc: 'Whether the field registers with the closest [Oito2Form], taking\npart in its validation, error summary and dirty state; true by\ndefault. When false, the field shows its own errors as outside a\nform.'), ApiParameter(name: 'controller', type: 'TextEditingController?', isRequired: false, isNamed: true, defaultValue: '', doc: 'The text controller; one is created when null.'), ApiParameter(name: 'focusNode', type: 'FocusNode?', isRequired: false, isNamed: true, defaultValue: '', doc: 'The focus node; one is created when null.'), ApiParameter(name: 'labelText', type: 'String?', isRequired: false, isNamed: true, defaultValue: '', doc: 'The field label.'), ApiParameter(name: 'hintText', type: 'String?', isRequired: false, isNamed: true, defaultValue: '', doc: 'The hint shown while the field is empty.'), ApiParameter(name: 'errorText', type: 'String?', isRequired: 