odes in [values] moved, in tree order, among\nthe children of [parentValue] (the top level when null) at [index],\nor at the end when [index] is null. [index] counts the children left\nafter the moved nodes are taken out. A moved node brings its\ndescendants along, and unknown values are ignored.\n\nThrows an [ArgumentError] when [parentValue] isn\'t in the tree, or is\none of the moved nodes or a descendant of one, and a [RangeError]\nwhen [index] is outside `0` to the number of remaining children.'), ApiMember(name: 'replace', signature: 'replace(String value, Oito2TreeNode<T> replacement) → Oito2TreeCollection<T>', doc: 'Returns a tree with the node [value] replaced by [replacement], or an\nequal tree when [value] is unknown.\n\nThrows an [ArgumentError] when [replacement] brings a value already\nused elsewhere in the tree.')], values: []),
  'Oito2TreeController': ApiEntry(kind: 'class', package: 'oito2_ui', doc: 'The expanded, selected and checked nodes of an [Oito2TreeView], by\nnode value.', signature: '', constructors: [ApiConstructor(name: 'Oito2TreeController', doc: 'Creates a tree controller with the given initial [expanded],\n[selected] and [checked] node values.\n\n[selected] is ignored when [selectionMode] is\n[Oito2SelectionMode.none].', isConst: false, isFactory: false, parameters: [ApiParameter(name: 'selectionMode', type: 'Oito2SelectionMode', isRequired: false, isNamed: true, defaultValue: 'Oito2SelectionMode.single', doc: 'How many nodes can be selected.'), ApiParameter(name: 'expanded', type: 'Iterable<String>', isRequired: false, isNamed: true, defaultValue: 'const []', doc: ''), ApiParameter(name: 'selected', type: 'Iterable<String>', isRequired: false, isNamed: true, defaultValue: 'const []', doc: ''), ApiParameter(name: 'checked', type: 'Iterable<String>', isRequired: false, isNamed: true, defaultValue: 'const []', doc: '')])], properties: [], methods: [ApiMember(name: 'isExpanded', signature: 'isExpanded(String value) → bool', doc: 'Whether the branch [value] is open.'), ApiMember(name: 'isSelected', signature: 'isSelected(String value) → bool', doc: 'Whether [value] is selected.'), ApiMember(name: 'setExpanded', signature: 'setExpanded(String value, bool expanded) → void', doc: 'Opens the branch [value] when [expanded] is true, or closes it.'), ApiMember(name: 'setExpandedValues', signature: 'setExpandedValues(Iterable<String> values) → void', doc: 'Opens exactly the branches in [values] and closes the others.'), ApiMember(name: 'expandAll', signature: 'expandAll(Oito2TreeCollection<Object?> collection) → void', doc: 'Opens every branch of [collection], keeping the branches already\nopen.'), ApiMember(name: 'reloadChildren', signature: 'reloadChildren(String value) → void', doc: 'Makes the tree views of this controller call\n[Oito2TreeView.onLoadChildren] for the branch [value] again, as if it\nhad never loaded: right away when the branch is open and empty, or\nelse the next time it opens empty.\n\nA tree loads an empty branch only the first time it opens; to\nrefresh a branch, the app empties its children in the collection and\ncalls this method.'), ApiMember(name: 'collapseAll', signature: 'collapseAll() → void', doc: 'Closes every branch.'), ApiMember(name: 'setSelected', signature: 'setSelected(Iterable<String> values) → void', doc: 'Makes [values] the selection: only the first one in single mode, and\nnone in [Oito2SelectionMode.none].'), ApiMember(name: 'toggleSelected', signature: 'toggleSelected(String value) → void', doc: 'Adds [value] to the selection or removes it, in multiple mode; in\nthe other modes it behaves as [setSelected] with [value] alone.'), ApiMember(name: 'checkStateOf', signature: 'checkStateOf(Oito2TreeCollection<Object?> collection, String value) → bool?', doc: 'The check state of [value] in [collection]: true or false, or null\nwhen only some of a branch\'s leaves are checked. A branch without\nleaves is unchecked.'), ApiMember(name: 'toggleChecked', signature: 'toggleChecked(Oito2TreeCollection<Object?> collection, String value) → void', doc: 'Checks [value], or every leaf of a branch, unless already fully\nchecked, in which case it unchecks them. Does nothing when\n[collection] has no node [value].')], values: []),
